    "check": "unopposed after a withdrawal: 'There were four nominations for the Ballyclare Urban Council election for three seats. [With] the withdrawal of the candidature of Mr. Huston Service there will be no poll taken... Samuel Douther, John Forsythe are declared to be re-elected, and John Hill, Main Street, declared elected.'",
